VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'entry-level iPad, and the iPhone 16, and the MacBook Neo. And once the upgrade goes live, or once the Apple Upgrade Program goes live, Apple stops taking new sign-ups for the iPhone Upgrade Program. So, the one real downgrade'

